      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITA'S MIRACLE (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Maiden at this track over 365m. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. FIRE ISLAND (3) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden after 15 starts. Hasn't been able to break through recently but continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. MIDNIGHT TRACEY (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 365m behind Tip Me Frank (21.65) in a Maiden. Has ability and can atone. SCOTCH CHASER (8) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
